      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A last-minute idea",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A change",
            "accent": "of plans."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Hinad was staying in Minori when she decided she would rather be in Amalfi for our photoshoot. Everything came together at the last minute. She moved over the evening before, with two boys along for the trip.",
            "I explained where we would meet, and she went to find the spot that same evening. I love that little detail. By morning, we could simply meet in the centre of Amalfi and set off towards Atrani."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / The light we came for",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "Right place.",
        "accent": "Right moment."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr0926",
        "cnr1032",
        "cnr1054",
        "cnr1108",
        "cnr1294",
        "cnr1456"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "The light we came for",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Right place.",
            "accent": "Right moment."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "This time, I got the timing exactly right. We reached the shore for the sunrise I had been hoping to catch, with the sun coming up behind her and the mountains still holding the softer light.",
            "Her colourful dress, the water, the first light on the buildings: there was so much to work with. These are the mornings when I find it very difficult to put the camera down."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dissolve",
      "eyebrow": "03 / A morning to keep",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "Nothing planned.",
