      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A morning to keep",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Nothing planned.",
            "accent": "Everything there."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "That is what I remember most about this session. It started with a sudden change of plans, and somehow brought us to precisely the right place at precisely the right time.",
            "We carried on by the water as the light changed. For me, this is one of those shoots where the morning itself becomes part of the story."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
